WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.464
At station 1, which direction is opposite to left? Let us think carefully. Opposites

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:09.224
point in reverse directions. The answer is right. Great work!

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:15.148
At station 2, which direction is opposite to up? Let us think carefully. Opposites

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:18.801
point in reverse directions. The answer is down. Great work!

00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:24.666
At station 3, which direction is opposite to forward? Let us think carefully.

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:28.939
Opposites point in reverse directions. The answer is backward. Great work!

00:00:29.783 --> 00:00:35.035
At station 4, which direction is opposite to north? Let us think carefully. Opposites

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:38.786
point in reverse directions. The answer is south. Great work!
